 "remarks": "Completely remodeled, contemporary, bright and spacious, 2 bedroom, 1 1/2 bath townhouse-style apartment in the Glenbrook area. The apartment is outfitted with Energy Star rated appliances, LED light fixtures, and two zone heating/cooling system controlled independently by two Nest thermostats to help you keep energy bills low. Open floor plan on the main level features a modern kitchen with Wi-Fi smart enabled appliances (stove is induction) and a living room that includes floating cabinets, Bose surround system, TV, and electric fireplace. Master bedroom on the upper level offers plenty of storage space with two wall-to-wall closets and includes another TV. Bathroom features air jet bath tub and floor heat. Also on the upper level are guest bedroom and laundry room. Attic offers additional storage. Parking is available in attached one car garage space and outside. 15'x7' storage room is conveniently located right off the garage. A 5 min walk to train, restaurants, cafes, shops, and more!",
